[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3181.03, "timestamp": "00:53:01", "text": "那颗心真的会……我的天哪。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3182.87, "timestamp": "00:53:02", "text": "我的上帝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3187.349, "timestamp": "00:53:07", "text": "你们还好吗？嗯，我想是的。我是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3190.069, "timestamp": "00:53:10", "text": "如果你想要的就是这种零碎的分解方式的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3193.03, "timestamp": "00:53:13", "text": "知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3202.39, "timestamp": "00:53:22", "text": "我的意思是，那简直把一切都抹去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3205.27, "timestamp": "00:53:25", "text": "地图上的敌人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3209.349, "timestamp": "00:53:29", "text": "我的天啊。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3212.63, "timestamp": "00:53:32", "text": "那东西差点杀了人，但事实并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3214.87, "timestamp": "00:53:34", "text": "敦促夺取地形控制权。等等，为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3218.87, "timestamp": "00:53:38", "text": "终端机不来了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3222.87, "timestamp": "00:53:42", "text": "呃，很遗憾，是个bug。什么？这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3225.589, "timestamp": "00:53:45", "text": "有故障。嗯，是啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3227.51, "timestamp": "00:53:47", "text": "这非常罕见，真的很少见。它不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3230.15, "timestamp": "00:53:50", "text": "这种情况经常发生。这是它的拆除"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3233.27, "timestamp": "00:53:53", "text": "民主否决。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3234.87, "timestamp": "00:53:54", "text": "圣"}]